{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, נְהַר","hw":"נְהַר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נְהַר</span></big><sub>14</sub>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:10\" href=\"/Daniel.7.10\">Dn 7:10</a> <strong>river (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, נָהַר²\" href=\"/BDB,_נָהַר²\", dir=\"rtl\">I. נהר</a><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:10\" href=\"/Daniel.7.10\">Dn 7:10</a>; emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">נַהֲרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:10\" href=\"/Ezra.4.10\">Ezr 4:10</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">א—ָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:16\" href=\"/Ezra.4.16\">4:16</a>;—<em>river</em>, usually of Euphr., in phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבַר נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:10\" href=\"/Ezra.4.10\">Ezr 4:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:11\" href=\"/Ezra.4.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:16\" href=\"/Ezra.4.16\">16</a> + 10 times Ezr; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ דִּי־נוּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:10\" href=\"/Daniel.7.10\">Dn 7:10</a> <em>a river of fire</em>, in vision.","next":"BDB Aramaic, נְהִיר","prev":"BDB Aramaic, נִדְנֵ֑ה"}